    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακῠλίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Luct.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <i>overturn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμάξας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.304f
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιλιοταλάντους ἀνακυλῖον οὐσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					116.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>roll away</i> or <i>back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακεκύλισται ὁ λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					16.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
